updates.body:
@channel There appears to be a routing error when a new subscription occurs. It is going to the Billing Team instead of the MA team. If you are assigned a new subscription ticket, please reassign this to the MA team. Tech is aware of the issue. Thank you!

-

@channel Important reminders and updates. Please give a thumbs up when you have reviewed the following:

-Employment Verification

If we receive a call from someone wanting employment verification with the company, please give them Lindsay’s email: lindsay@fountain.net

*** We do not provide employment verifications over the phone. ***

